    "body": "One thing to note is that the spaceship implementation uses `zsh` prompt sequences to get the hostname, which we can't do. We'll need to think about what the best way to get the hostname across all platforms is...\r\n\r\nEDIT: It looks like getting the hostname in a cross-platform setting is [surprisingly tricky](https://docs.rs/gethostname/0.2.0/src/gethostname/lib.rs.html), but we *can* do it either with a [crate](https://crates.io/crates/gethostname) or by calling `gethostname` in an `unsafe` block (Windows apparently has a binary-compatible function in their libc).",
